# Judge API keys. Copy this file to .env in this directory (gitignored) and
# fill in what you use:
#
#   cp engine/panel/.env.example engine/panel/.env
#
# Only NAME=value lines are read; lines starting with # are ignored. Do NOT put
# a comment after a value -- everything right of the first = becomes the value.
# A variable exported in your shell wins over this file.

# Simplest setup -- one key: any judge seat whose native key is absent below is
# routed through its OpenRouter mirror automatically (https://openrouter.ai).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Native provider keys (optional). When one is present, its seats call that
# provider directly instead of OpenRouter. The default frontier_fast panel:
#   sol      -> OPENAI_API_KEY      (GPT-5.6 Sol)
#   fable    -> ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   (Claude Fable 5)
#   deepseek -> DEEPINFRA_API_KEY   (DeepSeek V3.2; also the ~2-cent itest panel)
#OPENAI_API_KEY=
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#DEEPINFRA_API_KEY=

# Remaining providers from panel-config.json, only needed for custom panels.
#TOGETHER_API_KEY=
#GEMINI_API_KEY=
